			"title": "PMI Market(i)",
			"summary": "An internal iPad and iPhone app for Philip Morris field teams in the Nordics: shelf photos with tags, a store map, share of market and sync. I reviewed the legacy Objective-C codebase ahead of taking over its maintenance.",
			"tone": "violet",
